x}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a>:</b> <b>Leather</b> armor is made of the hide of animals. It provides decent protection without excessively restricting the user's movements.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\" width=\"450\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0001605000</span>1,605<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><b><a href=\"/page/Into_the_Deep\" title=\"Into the Deep\">Into the Deep</a></b>, End reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spearblock\" title=\"Spearblock\">Spearblock III</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spearblock\" title=\"Spearblock\">Spearblock III</a>:</b> Passive: Reduces physical damage taken by 6, except from Bludgeoning or Slashing weapons. (Damage Reduction: 6/Slash, Bludgeon)</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Feather_Falling\" title=\"Feather Falling\">Feather Falling</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Feather_Falling\" title=\"Feather Falling\">Feather Falling</a>:</b> This item is engraved with feathers and bestows a powerful magical effect. Whenever the wearer begins to fall from any height, this effect slows the descent dramatically, causing the wearer to fall like a feather.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Fortitude_save\" title=\"Fortitude save\"> Fortitude Save +5</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Fortitude_save\" title=\"Fortitude save\"> Fortitude Save +5</a>:</b> This item gives a +5 <a href=\"/page/Resistance_bonus\" title=\"Resistance bonus\">Resistance bonus</a> to your Fortitude saves.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Marshwalker\" title=\"Named item sets\">Marshwalker</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Marshwalker\" title=\"Named item sets\">Marshwalker</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+30% Enhancement bonus to movement speed<br />+3 Artifact bonus to Jump and Tumble</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Ring_of_the_Mire.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Ring_of_the_Mire.png/420px-Ring_of_the_Mire.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"386\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Ring_of_the_Mire.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Epic_Crafting\" title=\"Epic Crafting\">Epic Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Epic_Ring_of_the_Mire\" title=\"Item:Epic Ring of the Mire\">Epic Ring of the Mire</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This ring was crafted to ease travel through thick, overgrown marsh territory.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p><br />\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816161301\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.150 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3418/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 21812/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6148/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 12/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n123.88%  164.423     41 Template:IO\n100.00%  132.731      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  132.731      1 -total\n 96.35%  127.889      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 42.40%   56.275      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 41.69%   55.334      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 40.47%   53.722      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 39.22%   52.059      2 Template:InCategory\n 24.17%   32.082      6 Template:Popup\n 15.00%   19.915      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:12007-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816161301 and revision id 634298. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
